Comment: 9,0:22:03.59,0:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,TO BE CONTINUED
Comment: 9,0:23:29.05,0:23:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.48,0:00:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His heart...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:02.53,0:00:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why isn't it beating?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:06.03,0:00:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My father isn't dead.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:09.41,0:00:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get his Stand back,\Nhe'll come back to life.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:12.66,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that this power of yours
Dialogue: 9,0:00:16.58,0:00:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,is called a Stand.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to go see her. Jolyne...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.59,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jolyne Kujo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:30.34,0:00:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:31.72,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So Hermes learned\Nabout Stands
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.35,0:00:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and the discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:37.23,0:00:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When Hermes inserted McQueen's memory disc\Ninto him,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he came back to life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was resurrected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.40,0:00:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We can bring your father back\Nif we get his discs!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do with\Nthe janitor's discs?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:57.46,0:00:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I put them somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.21,0:01:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have both of them.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:02.04,0:01:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She says the guards would find them\Nduring the strip searches.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep his Stand,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:09.22,0:01:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll insert\Nhis memory disc later.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:15.05,0:01:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}McQueen's memory disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:01:17.85,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This disc contains information\Non Whitesnake.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:01:22.98,0:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And maybe{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:01:24.08,0:01:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be able to learn more\Nabout Dad's discs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:01:42.42,0:01:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:46.04,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, close the door!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:49.46,0:01:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just changing\Nthe tractor tire!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:53.93,0:01:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely touched it!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:57.35,0:01:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:00.39,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, get out of there!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:03.44,0:02:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the door!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:05.15,0:02:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:10.78,0:02:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so heavy!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:12.74,0:02:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull harder! It's almost closed.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:15.37,0:02:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:18.24,0:02:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NI told you to pull!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:24.54,0:02:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my arms.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:26.84,0:02:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:30.46,0:02:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:34.59,0:02:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,who wasn't pulling hard enough...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The weather is nice, as always.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:30.55,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tell me, Charlotte,\Nwhat's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were we called out here?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This afternoon,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:39.47,0:04:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,two inmates disappeared\Nin the farm sector.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:42.43,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't bode well.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:46.97,0:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn't have escaped.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:50.15,0:04:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have drowned in the swamps
Dialogue: 9,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,or gotten bitten by a snake.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:54.53,0:04:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we need to form\Na search party.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:57.74,0:05:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you mention\Nthe possibility of an alligator?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:02.87,0:05:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A female alligator?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:04.33,0:05:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.22,0:05:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't eat them!\NI'm innocent!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.80,0:05:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I called you here\Nto form a group of volunteers.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:20.47,0:05:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No money involved,\Nno reduced sentence either.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:25.06,0:05:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you for the sake of honor.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.56,0:05:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is any one of you volunteering?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got out of the punitive ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why put yourself through this on top of it?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:50.96,0:05:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you won't be going.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:53.67,0:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Five will be more than enough.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.84,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Head guard!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:00.55,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The inmates going to the farm
Dialogue: 9,0:06:02.97,0:06:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,must wear this bracelet,\Nwhich will keep them from running away.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Like a Virgin.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:09.35,0:06:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An invisible barrier.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:12.44,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you tamper with it
Dialogue: 9,0:06:16.61,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,or if it breaks,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:18.11,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it will explode.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:20.57,0:06:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, if you get more than 50 meters away\Nfrom me,
Dialogue: 9,0:06:23.66,0:06:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it will explode.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.70,0:06:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiping yourself without arms,\Nthat's not easy.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:45.34,0:06:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty meters?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have to run?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.32,0:07:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll each search on your own\Nstarting from here.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:10.45,0:07:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for the bushes.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:12.78,0:07:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligators hang around\Nin the swamps.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't be here.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:27.89,0:07:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you volunteer,\NJolyne?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:31.27,0:07:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it suits me just fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:34.48,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of things\NI want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:38.10,0:07:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,About the disc
Dialogue: 9,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and about Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:44.49,0:07:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you look at it?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:46.70,0:07:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,McQueen's disc, I mean?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I took a look at it.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:52.71,0:07:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It gave me a horrible sensation.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:55.25,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a vile stench\Nwas seeping into my brain.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:58.96,0:08:01.46,TiretsDefault,,587,0,0,, So you didn't notice, then.\N Notice what?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:01.59,0:08:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The images in that disc
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.67,0:08:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,contain clues about\NWhitesnake's goal.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:13.39,0:08:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}McQueen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This disc suits you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's yours now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:21.86,0:08:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here's your Stand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.03,0:08:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're hidden in a tire\Nof one of the farm tractors?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:33.95,0:08:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see several of them inside?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,His goal is to collect discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:39.75,0:08:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a collection\Nof Stands and memories
Dialogue: 9,0:08:42.34,0:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,stolen from other Stand users.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:46.51,0:08:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are dozens of discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be hiding them
Dialogue: 9,0:08:52.25,0:08:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,from the guards and the other inmates.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:55.01,0:08:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why\Nhe hides them in a tire.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.76,0:08:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The discs containing
Dialogue: 9,0:08:59.48,0:09:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,my father's Stand, Star Platinum,\Nand his memory must be there.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.40,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Your father?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:05.32,0:09:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're searching\Nfor your father's discs.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:10.45,0:09:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't know any more about him.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for the disc's tractor.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A tractor?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.63,0:09:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tons of them here.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.47,TiretsDefault,,769,0,0,, That barn.\N Yes.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.89,0:09:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two! Having fun?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:45.86,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is a picnic?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:48.61,0:09:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not searching at all!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:50.53,0:09:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we were talking about that barn.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:53.99,0:09:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go search over there.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:55.41,0:09:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You made us chase after you on purpose.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's having fun now, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:00.00,0:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! What are you mumbling?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:04.92,0:10:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised myself I'd run around\Nlike a bitch in heat.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How vulgar.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator dung.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:17.51,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:19.31,0:10:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You insolent little slut!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:20.52,0:10:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the head guard!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:26.40,0:10:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops. That was an accident.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:30.49,0:10:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The baton accidentally brushed\Nagainst the bracelet.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:35.41,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that ringing?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:37.20,0:10:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my bracelet ringing?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:38.87,0:10:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it on purpose.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You charged at me.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:44.04,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not going to explode, is it?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a sick joke.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.09,0:10:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay away from me.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:53.22,0:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It might explode\Nwhile you're too close to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.52,0:10:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.93,0:11:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry!\NI apologize!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:00.31,0:11:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it! I told you to stay away from me.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrest this...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:09.90,0:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:13.32,0:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go eat\Nalligator crap!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.63,0:11:33.26,TiretsDefault,,627,0,0,, It stopped.\N Don't panic, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:33.39,0:11:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That ringing was just a warning.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:37.47,0:11:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, guard?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.97,0:11:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:45.85,0:11:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what your power was.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:55.07,0:11:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here but tractors\Nand sacks of flour.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:58.91,0:12:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No point searching inside.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:01.62,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If this had been an easy mission,\Nthey wouldn't have needed volunteers.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:07.92,0:12:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.01,0:12:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here, Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:18.72,0:12:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the tractor.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The same tractor as in the disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.47,0:12:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With the same number.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:33.77,0:12:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Same model, same number. Number four.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in that tire.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:39.41,0:12:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find the discs\Nby taking the tire off.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:42.12,0:12:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your ears!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to comb the swamps.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:46.66,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The missing ones may have drowned.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:50.71,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Search for them.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:52.09,0:12:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he think? That we're going for a swim?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:55.84,0:12:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.42,0:12:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:59.63,0:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not an option.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:01.89,0:13:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off our backs.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:03.52,0:13:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We could catch some nasty crap\Nin these swamps!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a drag.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:08.77,0:13:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:10.44,0:13:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take the tire off!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:12.11,0:13:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:17.07,0:13:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something's really wrong.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. If we don't take the tire off\Nright now,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:21.95,0:13:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be too far from the guard.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:24.50,0:13:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:26.29,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He said: "Five will be more than enough."
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.50,0:13:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.33,0:13:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He said five inmates would be enough.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.67,0:13:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are six of us!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:36.59,0:13:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.64,0:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Counting you and me,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:43.39,0:13:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that makes six!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:45.47,0:13:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we were five\Nwhen we left.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:48.31,0:13:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't pay attention\Nto their clothes or their hairstyles.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Jolyne?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:54.90,0:13:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:56.86,0:13:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was busy catching up with you.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:58.78,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, everyone's wearing a bracelet.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.07,0:14:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:04.07,0:14:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we been six
Dialogue: 9,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,from the start?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:08.67,0:14:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You find it weird too, don't you?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.79,0:14:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be five, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:16.42,0:14:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who joined us?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:18.18,0:14:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I could be wrong.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:21.09,0:14:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, our numbers hardly matter.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:23.93,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been with me since the start.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:26.97,0:14:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember her.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:28.23,0:14:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Atroe.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.94,0:14:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She gets picked on a lot.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.87,0:14:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She volunteered\Nto get away from her bullies.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:35.15,0:14:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:38.61,0:14:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:43.20,0:14:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my bracelet ringing?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:46.74,0:14:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine too!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.66,0:14:52.33,TiretsDefault,,628,0,0,, Mine too.\N Damn it, they're all ringing!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:52.46,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be getting close\Nto the 50-meter limit.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.71,0:14:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But he can't be that far away.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard is gone!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:01.21,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.05,0:15:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The quad is covered in blood.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:10.35,0:15:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.65,0:15:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bracelets are still ringing,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.77,0:15:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the guard's body is moving away from us.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:17.69,0:15:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he drown?\NIs his body being carried away?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.98,0:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the guard!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be within 50 meters!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.74,0:15:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:26.61,0:15:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.53,0:15:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My bracelet's ringing is speeding up.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.46,0:15:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:40.29,0:15:43.30,TiretsDefault,,754,0,0,, She's dead.\N No, not this.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.51,0:15:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sixth one must be\Nattacking us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:46.64,0:15:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because we got close\Nto the discs?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.77,0:15:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's search for the guard within a 50-meter\Ncircle around her.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:58.35,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Get closer to him!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:59.90,0:16:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bracelets will stop ringing\Nand won't explode.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:03.61,0:16:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy is in this group.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a real psycho in here.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.45,0:16:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks suspicious.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.87,0:16:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The short-haired one.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:15.00,0:16:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And Atroe didn't recognize her.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:18.71,0:16:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be her.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:20.42,0:16:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Stand must have killed the guard.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kill her before she kills us.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:26.55,0:16:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming she's our enemy,
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.22,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,she must have been watching the discs\Nwithout interruption.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.77,0:16:38.60,TiretsDefault,,719,0,0,, That would make sense.\N That's impossible.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an inmate here.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:40.65,0:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,An inmate can't watch\Nthe discs around the clock.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:50.46,0:16:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, get back!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.70,TiretsDefault,,625,0,0,, There's something there!\N What?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:55.29,0:16:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the water!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:01.92,0:17:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.17,0:17:05.34,TiretsDefault,,631,0,0,, Did you see something?\N No.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.54,0:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:10.51,0:17:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's get out of these swamps.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:14.10,0:17:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not split up,\Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:18.28,0:17:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know who our enemy is.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.73,0:17:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. And these bracelets\Nmake things harder.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we can retrieve the discs,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.82,0:17:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to be within 50 meters\Nof the guard and the three other inmates.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:37.45,0:17:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's something in the bucket!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My head got sucked in!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:50.38,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this plankton-like thing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:57.02,0:17:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It split in two.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.18,0:18:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, in four!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:01.69,0:18:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These creatures...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bucket wasn't empty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:08.95,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't look carefully enough.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:10.95,0:18:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They were already in the water.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:20.95,0:18:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kiss!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:25.88,0:18:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.13,0:18:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, don't move.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:30.17,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The water is dangerous!\NThese things multiply!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They multiply very fast.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:36.51,0:18:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the water.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:38.01,0:18:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't make it in time.\NThe Stand set a trap for me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.82,0:18:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get him.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:55.82,0:18:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:58.24,0:18:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're walking on a thread.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.20,0:19:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you unraveling your own body?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, stay back.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:08.88,0:19:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this on my own!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:22.27,0:19:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:26.69,0:19:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:27.90,0:19:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy all right.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:30.51,0:19:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:32.57,0:19:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've been done for\Nif I hadn't unraveled so much thread.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your power.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a hole in your body.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:41.37,0:19:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She let it hit her\Nso she could latch onto it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, get out of the water now.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, Hermes!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:57.60,0:19:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:58.43,0:20:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Its shape comes from the plankton.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:01.93,0:20:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hiding in the little water\Nthere was in the bucket.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:04.73,0:20:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what dragged me under.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:06.44,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all that.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:07.77,0:20:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:10.65,0:20:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab it underwater.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.61,0:20:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The thread I unraveled.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.16,0:20:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Powerful and fast!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.42,0:20:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what's going on?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:34.38,0:20:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Stand's power must weaken{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:36.51,0:20:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}when its user moves away from it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It got me.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:41.18,0:20:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.10,0:20:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I stuck a sticker on him
Dialogue: 9,0:20:45.72,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,while latching onto his arm.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my power.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:03.74,0:21:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, away from the water!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:19.67,0:21:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not chasing us.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.43,0:21:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It only attacks when it's in the water.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:24.85,0:21:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:26.35,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is inmate FE32125.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:31.48,0:21:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard had an accident.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Send help immediately.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:36.40,0:21:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened\Nto you two?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:38.78,0:21:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you run on water?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:41.58,0:21:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You three, don't move!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.41,0:21:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go near the water!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:49.12,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even try to play tricks on us.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:51.67,0:21:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know one of you\Ndid this to us!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:57.75,0:22:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I retrieve the disc,
Dialogue: 9,0:22:00.67,0:22:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find out who its user is.
